This directory reuses the official CosyVoice FastAPI inference entrypoint and
zero-shot speaker caching APIs without modifying upstream model source files.

The local wrapper includes two runtime compatibility adaptations: it loads
audio with SoundFile and converts samples to the tensor layout expected by
CosyVoice, and its LLM `forward_one_step` adapter delegates to the
Transformers model and returns the final hidden state with the model cache.
These adaptations affect the wrapper process only; they do not modify the
upstream checkout or model weights.
